Engine: Godot 3.6, GLES2 renderer. GDScript 3.x syntax ONLY.
Use: onready var, export var, yield, connect("signal", self, "method"), KinematicBody2D, rand_range.
Never use: @onready, @export, await, CharacterBody2D, signal.connect(callable), Godot 4 APIs.
Build UI in code (add_child with Control nodes). Do not hand-write .tscn files except Main.tscn.
No art assets. Use colored rectangles, ColorRect, Label, Button, and _draw().
Only edit files the current task requires. Do not rename or delete existing functions.
After each task, list the files you changed and how to test.